      "content": "Attached is the latest draft of the Green Tech Subsidy Act and that internal impact report from the econ team that leaked this morning. Look, the report is bad news—the clause on localized manufacturing requirements is going to tank margins for our main clients in the short term. We have that meeting with Senator Vance on Thursday. He's the swing vote. We need a killer talking point that keeps him on board with the bill despite these industry concerns. Give me something we can use to pivot if he brings up the cost implications.",
